# CLAUDE.md - Project Guidelines for ppls-voice-recognition-speaker

## Overview
High-performance speaker recognition system identifying stars, athletes, and public voices via PyTorch embeddings, a custom C++ AVX-512 matching engine, an EVM blockchain anchor, and professional DAW telemetry (FL Studio / Pro Tools plugins).

## Tech Stack
- **AI/ML:** Python 3.11, PyTorch, SpeechBrain (ECAPA-TDNN), Silero VAD
- **Engine Core:** C++17, AVX-512 vectorization, Pybind11 bindings (`fast_matcher`)
- **API & Daemon:** FastAPI, Uvicorn, SQLite vector index
- **Smart Contracts:** Solidity 0.8.19, Hardhat, Monad EVM
- **DAW Telemetry:** VST3 / AAX real-time audio thread telemetry specs

## Development Commands
- **Setup Environment:** `./scripts/init_all.sh`
- **Build C++ Engine:** `./scripts/build_engine.sh`
- **Run Tests:** `pytest tests/ -v`
- **Start API Daemon:** `uvicorn src.api:app --reload`
